      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There are workarounds which let us destroy portals after players create them. But they're weird and complicated.\nThis canny proposes areas in which portals can be created: https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/world-request-designating-portal-drop-zones\nWe could implement this feature ourselves via triggers. The triggers would call the method to prevent portal creation in that area.",
